.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://img2.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20120809161518/spongebob/images/a/a0/Pizza_Delivery_Gallery_(40).jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T09:17:48-07:00","id":581034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tymeaus Jalynsfein</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/523870-dark-eras-character-sheets?p=524518#post524518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The skills do not change from Stone Age to Industrial Age at that point</div> </div> </div> </div>Um... Reqiem for Regina* should definitely have the Firearms skill, possibly alongside the Archery skill. However, Firearms is the one that should be on the sheet as standard.<br /> <br /> I'm hoping that we don't get overly complex borders, I'd prefer ones at the V20 level of detail, but just as long as we have sheets with the correct skills and X+Y splats for each era that's fine (although I would also like at least a mortals sheet per set of skills).<br /> <br /> *one of the three that intrigued me, the other two being Neolithic Mage and Book of Judges Hunter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T10:24:03-07:00","id":581157,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aurumae</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/523870-dark-eras-character-sheets?p=579320#post579320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What to do with Neolithic Mage though? 5500 BCE is pre-domestication of Horses (about 4500 BCE), and certainly pre-horseback riding</div> </div> </div> </div>Use the extra space from skills that aren't relevant in the Neolithic to make a reminder box of 'things that will kill me if I am not wary'.<br /> <br /> It's quite a long list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T10:36:22-07:00","id":581182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/523870-dark-eras-character-sheets?p=581157#post581157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Use the extra space from skills that aren't relevant in the Neolithic to make a reminder box of 'things that will kill me if I am not wary'.<br /> <br /> It's quite a long list.</div> </div> </div> </div><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><s>Tigers</s></li> <li><s>Staying in the sun too long</s></li> <li><s>Rock slides</s>\u200b</li> <li>EVERYTHING.</li> </ol><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T12:05:49-07:00","id":581350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/523870-dark-eras-character-sheets?p=581157#post581157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Use the extra space from skills that aren't relevant in the Neolithic to make a reminder box of 'things that will kill me if I am not wary'.<br /> <br /> It's quite a long list.</div> </div> </div> </div>In no particular order:<br /> 1. The weather.<br /> 2. Wolves.<br /> 3. Wolf monsters.<br /> 4. Hungry corpses.<br /> 5. Antagonistic spirits.<br /> 6. Friendly spirits.<br /> 7. Life partner.<br /> 8. God.<br /> 9. Priests.<br /> 10. Friends.<br /> 11. Deer.<br /> 12. Fire.<br /> 13. Trees.<br /> 14. Swamps.<br /> 15. Mountains.<br /> <br /> Just to name a few.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T01:10:08-07:00","id":855560,"title":"","content":"Reading <b>Dark Eras</b> backers version I would simple whole deal now. Any Era using Computers as Skill will be in reality &quot;modern Era&quot;, so use normal gamelins sheets, without modifications.<br /> <br /> For the <b>Dark Eras</b> we need two/three versions of historical char sheets - each have Enigmas instead of Computers:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>With added Archery in Physical ( next to Firearms ) and Ride <i>instead</i> of Drive.</b></li> <li><b>With added Archery in Physical ( next to Firearms ) and Drive Skill.</b></li> <li><b>With added Archery in Physical ( next to Firearms ) and <i>both</i> Drive and Ride Skills? </b>( It's question mark here as it is only one Era - Ruins of Empire - that would use this sheet and particular characters could work without one Skill or another. )</li> </ol><b>Reasoning: </b>Half of Eras are way before inventing any real Firearms so Archery it's crucial. However, later only two Eras <i>do not </i>use Archery to complete Skill list - and even then there could be made arguments that some exotic characters should still use Archery so Skill could be added even for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-30-2016, 04:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T01:15:15-07:00","id":855566,"title":"","content":"In addition to the altered Skill lists:<br /> <br /> Mages in The Sundered World do not have Orders. Werewolves in The Sundered World do not have Tribes, though many &quot;sects and cults&quot; are described.<br /> <br /> Mages in To The Strongest do not belong to Orders, but instead claim membership in Darshanas. They also belong to one of four Great Cults.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T01:22:33-07:00","id":855571,"title":"","content":"I think we should hammer out &quot;mortal&quot; sheet for all <b>Dark Eras</b> - then gamelines specific changes will be neatly putted on them. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T18:12:06-07:00","id":856811,"title":"","content":"Whoa...I am like way late on this one. Not sure how I got so far behind...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/523870-dark-eras-character-sheets?p=579100#post579100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&lt;Checking V20 sheets&gt; Yes, like this one. One extra line in each Skill category and those lines to be editable - should be enough. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> But in Physicial we need at least two extra lines - for Ride and Archery added in.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have to see I guess, depends on if I can make room...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/523870-dark-eras-character-sheets?p=579100#post579100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And as mine buddy from RPG club is prepering 60s <b>Hunter</b> game - could we got GMC Vigil sheet made in to for this Dark Era? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It's only humble question...</div> </div> </div> </div>I can add it to the list. So just a HtV sheet with some of the GMC stuff added?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div clas